{"zh": "<div><section class=\"ch\" id=\"ch4\" style=\"--acc:var(--red)\">\n\n<p class=\"lead rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"“100% Retrieval Accuracy” is nearly impossible to guarantee in an open enterprise knowledge base. A more realistic goal is \" data-i18n-zh=\"“100% Retrieval Accuracy”在开放企业知识库中几乎无法保证，更合理的目标是 \">“100% Retrieval Accuracy”在开放企业知识库中几乎无法保证，更合理的目标是 </span><strong>100% Trustworthy Answering</strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\": evidence available → answer; partially sufficient → partial answer; unclear → clarify; insufficient → retrieve more or refuse; high risk → escalate to a human.\" data-i18n-zh=\"：有证据→回答；部分充分→部分回答；不清楚→澄清；不足→继续检索或拒答；高风险→人工升级。\">：有证据→回答；部分充分→部分回答；不清楚→澄清；不足→继续检索或拒答；高风险→人工升级。</span></p>\n<div class=\"co warn rv\"><span class=\"co-t\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Why “refuse if you do not know” in the Prompt is not enough\" data-i18n-zh=\"为什么 Prompt 写“不知道就拒答”不够\">为什么 Prompt 写“不知道就拒答”不够</span></span><p><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"A Prompt can influence behavior, but it cannot prove that the Retriever missed nothing · the document truly supports the conclusion · documents do not conflict · no critical reasoning hop is missing · the document version is valid · the user is authorized.\" data-i18n-zh=\"Prompt 只能影响行为，不能证明：Retriever 没有漏召 · 文档确实支持结论 · 文档没有冲突 · 关键推理跳没有缺失 · 文档版本有效 · 用户有权限。\">Prompt 只能影响行为，不能证明：Retriever 没有漏召 · 文档确实支持结论 · 文档没有冲突 · 关键推理跳没有缺失 · 文档版本有效 · 用户有权限。</span></p><p class=\"say\" style=\"margin-top:8px;font-size:15px\">Prompt can encourage abstention. It cannot prove that abstention is correct.</p></div>\n<div class=\"bfs-canvas bfs-density-compact bfs-compact-list rv\" id=\"fig-4-1\">\n<div class=\"bfs-head\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"bfs-tag\"><span class=\"bfs-tag-dot\"></span>FIG.4.1</span>\n<h2 class=\"bfs-title\">六层 Gate 流水线</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bfs-body\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">\n<div class=\"bfs-flow-container\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\"><div class=\"bfs-card bfs-blue\">\n<div class=\"bfs-strip\"></div>\n<div class=\"bfs-card-head\"><span class=\"bfs-stage-pill\">STEP 1</span></div>\n<h2 class=\"bfs-card-title\">Gate 0 · Query Analysis</h2><div class=\"bfs-card-desc\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"domain · intent · entity · time scope · risk · required evidence — “How much is it?” is missing an entity → Clarify instead of directly refusing as OOD\" data-i18n-zh=\"domain · intent · entity · time scope · risk · required evidence —— “它多少钱？”缺实体 → Clarify，而不是直接 OOD 拒答\">domain · intent · entity · time scope · risk · required evidence —— “它多少钱？”缺实体 → Clarify，而不是直接 OOD 拒答</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\"><div class=\"bfs-card bfs-blue\">\n<div class=\"bfs-strip\"></div>\n<div class=\"bfs-card-head\"><span class=\"bfs-stage-pill\">STEP 2</span></div>\n<h2 class=\"bfs-card-title\">Gate 1 · Knowledge Coverage</h2><div class=\"bfs-card-desc\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"supported domains · time coverage · entity catalog · document types · capability registry (theoretical coverage ≠ a concrete answer definitely exists)\" data-i18n-zh=\"支持域 · 时间覆盖 · 实体目录 · 文档类型 · 能力注册表（理论覆盖 ≠ 具体答案一定存在）\">支持域 · 时间覆盖 · 实体目录 · 文档类型 · 能力注册表（理论覆盖 ≠ 具体答案一定存在）</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\"><div class=\"bfs-card bfs-amber\">\n<div class=\"bfs-strip\"></div>\n<div class=\"bfs-card-head\"><span class=\"bfs-stage-pill\">STEP 3</span></div>\n<h2 class=\"bfs-card-title\">Gate 2 · Retrieval Quality</h2><div class=\"bfs-card-desc\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Combined signals: Exact hit · Top-K score · Reranker score · Score margin · Retriever agreement · Source authority · Freshness · Metadata match.\" data-i18n-zh=\"联合信号：Exact hit · Top-K score · Reranker score · Score margin · Retriever agreement · Source authority · Freshness · Metadata match。\">联合信号：Exact hit · Top-K score · Reranker score · Score margin · Retriever agreement · Source authority · Freshness · Metadata match。</span><mark><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"A low score only means “uncertain”; it does not prove “the knowledge base definitely has no answer.”\" data-i18n-zh=\"低分只说明“不确定”，不能证明“知识库一定没有”\">低分只说明“不确定”，不能证明“知识库一定没有”</span></mark></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\"><div class=\"bfs-card bfs-teal\">\n<div class=\"bfs-strip\"></div>\n<div class=\"bfs-card-head\"><span class=\"bfs-stage-pill\">STEP 4</span></div>\n<h2 class=\"bfs-card-title\">Gate 3 · Evidence Sufficiency</h2><div class=\"bfs-card-desc\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Classification: SUPPORT / REFUTE / IRRELEVANT / INSUFFICIENT / CONFLICT. The question is not “is the document relevant?” but “is the evidence set sufficient to support the complete answer?” — Set-level checks: is a multi-hop link missing? do sources conflict? is there only background context? are some parts of a multipart question uncovered?\" data-i18n-zh=\"分类：SUPPORT / REFUTE / IRRELEVANT / INSUFFICIENT / CONFLICT。问题不是“文档相关吗”，而是“证据合起来是否足以支持完整答案？”——Set-level：多跳缺一跳？来源冲突？只有背景？多部分未全覆盖？\">分类：SUPPORT / REFUTE / IRRELEVANT / INSUFFICIENT / CONFLICT。问题不是“文档相关吗”，而是“证据合起来是否足以支持完整答案？”——Set-level：多跳缺一跳？来源冲突？只有背景？多部分未全覆盖？</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\"><div class=\"bfs-card bfs-purple\">\n<div class=\"bfs-strip\"></div>\n<div class=\"bfs-card-head\"><span class=\"bfs-stage-pill\">STEP 5</span></div>\n<h2 class=\"bfs-card-title\">Gate 4 · Claim Verification</h2><div class=\"bfs-card-desc\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Answer → Claim Extraction → Claim–Evidence Alignment → Support Check. For every key Claim: evidence exists · citation is correct · scope is not exceeded · “possible” is not turned into “certain.”\" data-i18n-zh=\"Answer → Claim Extraction → Claim–Evidence Alignment → Support Check。每个关键 Claim：有证据 · 引用正确 · 不超范围 · 不把“可能”说成“确定”\">Answer → Claim Extraction → Claim–Evidence Alignment → Support Check。每个关键 Claim：有证据 · 引用正确 · 不超范围 · 不把“可能”说成“确定”</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\"><div class=\"bfs-card bfs-emerald\">\n<div class=\"bfs-strip\"></div>\n<div class=\"bfs-card-head\"><span class=\"bfs-stage-pill\">STEP 6</span></div>\n<h2 class=\"bfs-card-title\">Gate 5 · Decision Policy</h2><div class=\"bfs-card-desc\">ANSWER · PARTIAL_ANSWER · CLARIFY · RETRIEVE_MORE · ROUTE_TO_OTHER_SOURCE · ESCALATE · REFUSE</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"co must rv interp-callout interp-engineering\"><span class=\"co-t\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Must Remember\" data-i18n-zh=\"必背\">必背</span></span><p class=\"say\">Relevant evidence is not necessarily sufficient evidence.</p></div>\n<div class=\"two\">\n<div>\n<h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"section-1\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"How to Set the Threshold\" data-i18n-zh=\"Threshold 怎么设\">Threshold 怎么设</span></h2>\n<pre aria-label=\"代码示例\" class=\"code rv\" data-i18n-pre-en=\" # ✗ Do not hard-code\n if similarity &lt; 0.8:\n     refuse()\" data-i18n-pre-zh=\" # ✗ 不要写死\n if similarity &lt; 0.8:\n     refuse()\" data-l=\"ANTI-PATTERN\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"> # ✗ 不要写死\n if similarity &lt; 0.8:\n     refuse()</pre>\n<div class=\"bfs-canvas bfs-density-compact bfs-compact-list rv\" id=\"fig-4-2\">\n<div class=\"bfs-head\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"bfs-tag\"><span class=\"bfs-tag-dot\"></span>FIG.4.2</span>\n<h2 class=\"bfs-title\">校准流程</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bfs-body\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">\n<div class=\"bfs-flow-container\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\"><div class=\"bfs-card bfs-blue\">\n<div class=\"bfs-strip\"></div>\n<div class=\"bfs-card-head\"><span class=\"bfs-stage-pill\">STEP 1</span></div>\n<h2 class=\"bfs-card-title\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Representative Evaluation Set\" data-i18n-zh=\"代表性评测集\">代表性评测集</span></h2><div class=\"bfs-card-desc\">Answerable · Unanswerable in-domain · OOD · Outdated · Conflicting · Partial evidence</div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\"><div class=\"bfs-card bfs-amber\">\n<div class=\"bfs-strip\"></div>\n<div class=\"bfs-card-head\"><span class=\"bfs-stage-pill\">STEP 2</span></div>\n<h2 class=\"bfs-card-title\">Threshold Calibration</h2><div class=\"bfs-card-desc\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Calibrate separately by domain / query type / language / retriever / risk\" data-i18n-zh=\"按 domain / query type / language / retriever / risk 分别校准\">按 domain / query type / language / retriever / risk 分别校准</span></div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"section-2\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Key Metrics and Trade-offs\" data-i18n-zh=\"关键指标与权衡\">关键指标与权衡</span></h2>\n<div class=\"chips rv\">\n<span class=\"chip\" style=\"--c:var(--grn)\">Coverage</span><span class=\"chip\" style=\"--c:var(--red)\">Selective Risk</span><span class=\"chip\" style=\"--c:var(--red)\">Unsafe Answer Rate</span><span class=\"chip\" style=\"--c:var(--org)\">False Refusal Rate</span><span class=\"chip\" style=\"--c:var(--blu)\">Citation Correctness</span><span class=\"chip\" style=\"--c:var(--blu)\">Citation Completeness</span><span class=\"chip\" style=\"--c:var(--pur)\">Conflict Detection Rate</span><span class=\"chip\" style=\"--c:var(--tea)\">Evidence Sufficiency Accuracy</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"co note rv interp-callout interp-failure\"><span class=\"co-t\">Risk–Coverage Curve</span><p style=\"font-size:13.5px\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"More refusals reduce coverage, but selective risk falls only if the policy preferentially rejects wrong answers. Measure the\" data-i18n-zh=\"拒答更多会降低覆盖率，但只有优先拒绝错误答案才可能降低选择性风险。因此要实测\">拒答更多会降低覆盖率，但只有优先拒绝错误答案才可能降低选择性风险。因此要实测</span><strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"risk–coverage curve\" data-i18n-zh=\"风险-覆盖曲线\">风险-覆盖曲线</span></strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\", not a single accuracy point.\" data-i18n-zh=\"，而不是单点准确率。\">，而不是单点准确率。</span></p></div>\n<div class=\"co en rv\"><span class=\"co-t\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"High-quality Refusal Template\" data-i18n-zh=\"高质量拒答模板\">高质量拒答模板</span></span><p class=\"say\" style=\"font-size:14.5px\">I could not find sufficient evidence in the approved knowledge sources to answer this reliably. I found general information about the process, but not the specific threshold you asked about. Please provide the relevant policy version or ask an authorized expert to confirm it.</p><p style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--mut);margin-top:6px\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Include: what was found · what is missing · why the system cannot answer · the next step. But\" data-i18n-zh=\"包含：找到什么 · 缺少什么 · 为什么不能回答 · 下一步。但\">包含：找到什么 · 缺少什么 · 为什么不能回答 · 下一步。但</span><strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"must not reveal\" data-i18n-zh=\"不能泄漏\">不能泄漏</span></strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"“there is a sensitive file you are not authorized to access.”\" data-i18n-zh=\"“存在某个你无权访问的敏感文件”。\">“存在某个你无权访问的敏感文件”。</span></p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- ======================= CH5 ======================= -->\n<aside class=\"co note\" id=\"verification-04-20260928\"><span class=\"co-t\">2026-09-28 · <span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Verification boundaries\" data-i18n-zh=\"验证边界\">验证边界</span></span><p><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Coverage is answered requests divided by all requests. Selective risk is wrong answers divided by answered requests, undefined with zero answers. More refusals do not guarantee lower risk. Six Gates is an engineering synthesis, not proof of future reliability.\" data-i18n-zh=\"Coverage = 回答数/请求数；Selective Risk = 错误回答数/回答数，零回答时未定义。多拒答不保证低风险。Six Gates 是工程综合，有限评测不能证明所有未来请求都可靠。\">Coverage = 回答数/请求数；Selective Risk = 错误回答数/回答数，零回答时未定义。多拒答不保证低风险。Six Gates 是工程综合，有限评测不能证明所有未来请求都可靠。</span></p><p><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1705.08500\">Selective Classification</a></p></aside>\n</div>", "en": "<div><section class=\"ch\" id=\"ch4\" style=\"--acc:var(--red)\">\n<p class=\"lead rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"“100% Retrieval Accuracy” is nearly impossible to guarantee in an open enterprise knowledge base. A more realistic goal is \" data-i18n-zh=\"“100% Retrieval Accuracy”在开放企业知识库中几乎无法保证，更合理的目标是 \">“100% Retrieval Accuracy” is nearly impossible to guarantee in an open enterprise knowledge base. A more realistic goal is </span><strong>100% Trustworthy Answering</strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\": evidence available → answer; partially sufficient → partial answer; unclear → clarify; insufficient → retrieve more or refuse; high risk → escalate to a human.\" data-i18n-zh=\"：有证据→回答；部分充分→部分回答；不清楚→澄清；不足→继续检索或拒答；高风险→人工升级。\">: evidence available → answer; partially sufficient → partial answer; unclear → clarify; insufficient → retrieve more or refuse; high risk → escalate to a human.</span></p>\n<div class=\"co warn rv\"><span class=\"co-t\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Why “refuse if you do not know” in the Prompt is not enough\" data-i18n-zh=\"为什么 Prompt 写“不知道就拒答”不够\">Why “refuse if you do not know” in the Prompt is not enough</span></span><p><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"A Prompt can influence behavior, but it cannot prove that the Retriever missed nothing · the document truly supports the conclusion · documents do not conflict · no critical reasoning hop is missing · the document version is valid · the user is authorized.\" data-i18n-zh=\"Prompt 只能影响行为，不能证明：Retriever 没有漏召 · 文档确实支持结论 · 文档没有冲突 · 关键推理跳没有缺失 · 文档版本有效 · 用户有权限。\">A Prompt can influence behavior, but it cannot prove that the Retriever missed nothing · the document truly supports the conclusion · documents do not conflict · no critical reasoning hop is missing · the document version is valid · the user is authorized.</span></p><p class=\"say\" style=\"margin-top:8px;font-size:15px\">Prompt can encourage abstention. It cannot prove that abstention is correct.</p></div>\n<div class=\"bfs-canvas bfs-density-compact bfs-compact-list rv\" id=\"fig-4-1\">\n<div class=\"bfs-head\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"bfs-tag\"><span class=\"bfs-tag-dot\"></span>FIG.4.1</span>\n<h2 class=\"bfs-title\">Six-layer Gate Pipeline</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bfs-body\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">\n<div class=\"bfs-flow-container\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\"><div class=\"bfs-card bfs-blue\">\n<div class=\"bfs-strip\"></div>\n<div class=\"bfs-card-head\"><span class=\"bfs-stage-pill\">STEP 1</span></div>\n<h2 class=\"bfs-card-title\">Gate 0 · Query Analysis</h2><div class=\"bfs-card-desc\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"domain · intent · entity · time scope · risk · required evidence — “How much is it?” is missing an entity → Clarify instead of directly refusing as OOD\" data-i18n-zh=\"domain · intent · entity · time scope · risk · required evidence —— “它多少钱？”缺实体 → Clarify，而不是直接 OOD 拒答\">domain · intent · entity · time scope · risk · required evidence — “How much is it?” is missing an entity → Clarify instead of directly refusing as OOD</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\"><div class=\"bfs-card bfs-blue\">\n<div class=\"bfs-strip\"></div>\n<div class=\"bfs-card-head\"><span class=\"bfs-stage-pill\">STEP 2</span></div>\n<h2 class=\"bfs-card-title\">Gate 1 · Knowledge Coverage</h2><div class=\"bfs-card-desc\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"supported domains · time coverage · entity catalog · document types · capability registry (theoretical coverage ≠ a concrete answer definitely exists)\" data-i18n-zh=\"支持域 · 时间覆盖 · 实体目录 · 文档类型 · 能力注册表（理论覆盖 ≠ 具体答案一定存在）\">supported domains · time coverage · entity catalog · document types · capability registry (theoretical coverage ≠ a concrete answer definitely exists)</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\"><div class=\"bfs-card bfs-amber\">\n<div class=\"bfs-strip\"></div>\n<div class=\"bfs-card-head\"><span class=\"bfs-stage-pill\">STEP 3</span></div>\n<h2 class=\"bfs-card-title\">Gate 2 · Retrieval Quality</h2><div class=\"bfs-card-desc\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Combined signals: Exact hit · Top-K score · Reranker score · Score margin · Retriever agreement · Source authority · Freshness · Metadata match.\" data-i18n-zh=\"联合信号：Exact hit · Top-K score · Reranker score · Score margin · Retriever agreement · Source authority · Freshness · Metadata match。\">Combined signals: Exact hit · Top-K score · Reranker score · Score margin · Retriever agreement · Source authority · Freshness · Metadata match.</span><mark><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"A low score only means “uncertain”; it does not prove “the knowledge base definitely has no answer.”\" data-i18n-zh=\"低分只说明“不确定”，不能证明“知识库一定没有”\">A low score only means “uncertain”; it does not prove “the knowledge base definitely has no answer.”</span></mark></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\"><div class=\"bfs-card bfs-teal\">\n<div class=\"bfs-strip\"></div>\n<div class=\"bfs-card-head\"><span class=\"bfs-stage-pill\">STEP 4</span></div>\n<h2 class=\"bfs-card-title\">Gate 3 · Evidence Sufficiency</h2><div class=\"bfs-card-desc\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Classification: SUPPORT / REFUTE / IRRELEVANT / INSUFFICIENT / CONFLICT. The question is not “is the document relevant?” but “is the evidence set sufficient to support the complete answer?” — Set-level checks: is a multi-hop link missing? do sources conflict? is there only background context? are some parts of a multipart question uncovered?\" data-i18n-zh=\"分类：SUPPORT / REFUTE / IRRELEVANT / INSUFFICIENT / CONFLICT。问题不是“文档相关吗”，而是“证据合起来是否足以支持完整答案？”——Set-level：多跳缺一跳？来源冲突？只有背景？多部分未全覆盖？\">Classification: SUPPORT / REFUTE / IRRELEVANT / INSUFFICIENT / CONFLICT. The question is not “is the document relevant?” but “is the evidence set sufficient to support the complete answer?” — Set-level checks: is a multi-hop link missing? do sources conflict? is there only background context? are some parts of a multipart question uncovered?</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\"><div class=\"bfs-card bfs-purple\">\n<div class=\"bfs-strip\"></div>\n<div class=\"bfs-card-head\"><span class=\"bfs-stage-pill\">STEP 5</span></div>\n<h2 class=\"bfs-card-title\">Gate 4 · Claim Verification</h2><div class=\"bfs-card-desc\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Answer → Claim Extraction → Claim–Evidence Alignment → Support Check. For every key Claim: evidence exists · citation is correct · scope is not exceeded · “possible” is not turned into “certain.”\" data-i18n-zh=\"Answer → Claim Extraction → Claim–Evidence Alignment → Support Check。每个关键 Claim：有证据 · 引用正确 · 不超范围 · 不把“可能”说成“确定”\">Answer → Claim Extraction → Claim–Evidence Alignment → Support Check. For every key Claim: evidence exists · citation is correct · scope is not exceeded · “possible” is not turned into “certain.”</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\"><div class=\"bfs-card bfs-emerald\">\n<div class=\"bfs-strip\"></div>\n<div class=\"bfs-card-head\"><span class=\"bfs-stage-pill\">STEP 6</span></div>\n<h2 class=\"bfs-card-title\">Gate 5 · Decision Policy</h2><div class=\"bfs-card-desc\">ANSWER · PARTIAL_ANSWER · CLARIFY · RETRIEVE_MORE · ROUTE_TO_OTHER_SOURCE · ESCALATE · REFUSE</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"co must rv interp-callout interp-engineering\"><span class=\"co-t\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Must Remember\" data-i18n-zh=\"必背\">Must Remember</span></span><p class=\"say\">Relevant evidence is not necessarily sufficient evidence.</p></div>\n<div class=\"two\">\n<div>\n<h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"section-1\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"How to Set the Threshold\" data-i18n-zh=\"Threshold 怎么设\">How to Set the Threshold</span></h2>\n<pre aria-label=\"Code example\" class=\"code rv\" data-i18n-pre-en=\" # ✗ Do not hard-code\n if similarity &lt; 0.8:\n     refuse()\" data-i18n-pre-zh=\" # ✗ 不要写死\n if similarity &lt; 0.8:\n     refuse()\" data-l=\"ANTI-PATTERN\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"> # ✗ Do not hard-code\n if similarity &lt; 0.8:\n     refuse()</pre>\n<div class=\"bfs-canvas bfs-density-compact bfs-compact-list rv\" id=\"fig-4-2\">\n<div class=\"bfs-head\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"bfs-tag\"><span class=\"bfs-tag-dot\"></span>FIG.4.2</span>\n<h2 class=\"bfs-title\">Calibration Flow</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bfs-body\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">\n<div class=\"bfs-flow-container\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\"><div class=\"bfs-card bfs-blue\">\n<div class=\"bfs-strip\"></div>\n<div class=\"bfs-card-head\"><span class=\"bfs-stage-pill\">STEP 1</span></div>\n<h2 class=\"bfs-card-title\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Representative Evaluation Set\" data-i18n-zh=\"代表性评测集\">Representative Evaluation Set</span></h2><div class=\"bfs-card-desc\">Answerable · Unanswerable in-domain · OOD · Outdated · Conflicting · Partial evidence</div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\"><div class=\"bfs-card bfs-amber\">\n<div class=\"bfs-strip\"></div>\n<div class=\"bfs-card-head\"><span class=\"bfs-stage-pill\">STEP 2</span></div>\n<h2 class=\"bfs-card-title\">Threshold Calibration</h2><div class=\"bfs-card-desc\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Calibrate separately by domain / query type / language / retriever / risk\" data-i18n-zh=\"按 domain / query type / language / retriever / risk 分别校准\">Calibrate separately by domain / query type / language / retriever / risk</span></div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"section-2\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Key Metrics and Trade-offs\" data-i18n-zh=\"关键指标与权衡\">Key Metrics and Trade-offs</span></h2>\n<div class=\"chips rv\">\n<span class=\"chip\" style=\"--c:var(--grn)\">Coverage</span><span class=\"chip\" style=\"--c:var(--red)\">Selective Risk</span><span class=\"chip\" style=\"--c:var(--red)\">Unsafe Answer Rate</span><span class=\"chip\" style=\"--c:var(--org)\">False Refusal Rate</span><span class=\"chip\" style=\"--c:var(--blu)\">Citation Correctness</span><span class=\"chip\" style=\"--c:var(--blu)\">Citation Completeness</span><span class=\"chip\" style=\"--c:var(--pur)\">Conflict Detection Rate</span><span class=\"chip\" style=\"--c:var(--tea)\">Evidence Sufficiency Accuracy</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"co note rv interp-callout interp-failure\"><span class=\"co-t\">Risk–Coverage Curve</span><p style=\"font-size:13.5px\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"More refusals reduce coverage, but selective risk falls only if the policy preferentially rejects wrong answers. Measure the\" data-i18n-zh=\"拒答更多会降低覆盖率，但只有优先拒绝错误答案才可能降低选择性风险。因此要实测\">More refusals reduce coverage, but selective risk falls only if the policy preferentially rejects wrong answers. Measure the</span><strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"risk–coverage curve\" data-i18n-zh=\"风险-覆盖曲线\">risk–coverage curve</span></strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\", not a single accuracy point.\" data-i18n-zh=\"，而不是单点准确率。\">, not a single accuracy point.</span></p></div>\n<div class=\"co en rv\"><span class=\"co-t\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"High-quality Refusal Template\" data-i18n-zh=\"高质量拒答模板\">High-quality Refusal Template</span></span><p class=\"say\" style=\"font-size:14.5px\">I could not find sufficient evidence in the approved knowledge sources to answer this reliably. I found general information about the process, but not the specific threshold you asked about. Please provide the relevant policy version or ask an authorized expert to confirm it.</p><p style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--mut);margin-top:6px\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Include: what was found · what is missing · why the system cannot answer · the next step. But\" data-i18n-zh=\"包含：找到什么 · 缺少什么 · 为什么不能回答 · 下一步。但\">Include: what was found · what is missing · why the system cannot answer · the next step. But</span><strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"must not reveal\" data-i18n-zh=\"不能泄漏\">must not reveal</span></strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"“there is a sensitive file you are not authorized to access.”\" data-i18n-zh=\"“存在某个你无权访问的敏感文件”。\">“there is a sensitive file you are not authorized to access.”</span></p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n ======================= CH5 ======================= \n<aside class=\"co note\" id=\"verification-04-20260928\"><span class=\"co-t\">2026-09-28 · <span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Verification boundaries\" data-i18n-zh=\"验证边界\">Verification boundaries</span></span><p><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Coverage is answered requests divided by all requests. Selective risk is wrong answers divided by answered requests, undefined with zero answers. More refusals do not guarantee lower risk. Six Gates is an engineering synthesis, not proof of future reliability.\" data-i18n-zh=\"Coverage = 回答数/请求数；Selective Risk = 错误回答数/回答数，零回答时未定义。多拒答不保证低风险。Six Gates 是工程综合，有限评测不能证明所有未来请求都可靠。\">Coverage is answered requests divided by all requests. Selective risk is wrong answers divided by answered requests, undefined with zero answers. More refusals do not guarantee lower risk. Six Gates is an engineering synthesis, not proof of future reliability.</span></p><p><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1705.08500\">Selective Classification</a></p></aside>\n</div>", "sections": [{"id": "section-1", "zh": "Threshold 怎么设", "en": "How to Set the Threshold"}, {"id": "section-2", "zh": "关键指标与权衡", "en": "Key Metrics and Trade-offs"}], "supplements": []}